{"text":"The summer before we opened Parnassus Books, I went on tour. I've been going on tour regularly since 1992. This one for a novel I wrote called State of Wonder was going to be my fact-finding mission. I collected information from all the booksellers I knew, but the most valuable came from my friend Daniel Golden at Boswell Books in Milwaukee. He told me people were desperate to buy anything that was hanging from the ceiling, which is true. More importantly, he told me to put the children's section as far away from the front door as possible so that when a child makes a break for it, you have the maximum opportunity to capture. Daniel talked a lot about the children's section, which was not a part of bookstores I knew much about. If you want customers, he said, you have to raise them yourself.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.88},{"text":"summer","start":0.88,"end":1.14},{"text":"before","start":1.14,"end":1.56},{"text":"we","start":1.56,"end":1.78},{"text":"opened","start":1.78,"end":2.28},{"text":"Parnassus","start":2.28,"end":3.06},{"text":"Books","start":3.06,"end":3.32,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":3.6,"end":3.62},{"text":"went","start":3.62,"end":3.82},{"text":"on","start":3.82,"end":4.06},{"text":"tour","start":4.06,"end":4.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"I've","start":5.04,"end":5.18},{"text":"been","start":5.18,"end":5.3},{"text":"going","start":5.3,"end":5.6},{"text":"on","start":5.6,"end":5.98},{"text":"tour","start":5.98,"end":6.38},{"text":"regularly","start":6.38,"end":6.98},{"text":"since","start":6.98,"end":7.4},{"text":"1992","start":7.4,"end":8.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"This","start":9.32,"end":9.68},{"text":"one","start":9.68,"end":10.24},{"text":"for","start":10.24,"end":10.72},{"text":"a","start":10.72,"end":10.98},{"text":"novel","start":10.98,"end":11.32},{"text":"I","start":11.32,"end":12.02},{"text":"wrote","start":12.02,"end":12.62},{"text":"called","start":12.62,"end":13.16},{"text":"State","start":13.16,"end":13.62},{"text":"